ntally cuts her bangs way too short. At first she doesn't care, but gets more embarrassed until she hides her face from Nariyuki and dons a mask.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-10-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/isyIwshUUP9heB3i49dEpUkJzbT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/isyIwshUUP9heB3i49dEpUkJzbT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/87432/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"1946863","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At the library, a beautiful girl Nariyuki has never seen before sits next to him when he's studying. He's nervous that he's getting hit on, not realizing the girl is actually Rizu, who has changed her hairstyle at a salon.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-10-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eSwShvqllIB9sE4dZPaUE0oYgqg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eSwShvqllIB9sE4dZPaUE0oYgqg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/87432/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"1947162","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At Nariyuki's house, Fumino is on her way out after a study session when he gives her a birthday present. However, when Fumino opens it, she's startled to find a bra. What was Nariyuki thinking?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-11-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mPQYsoGl099Xhch2xfMuw4gECZK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mPQYsoGl099Xhch2xfMuw4gECZK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/87432/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"1947163","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"va